              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, justice Breyer inquired whether the same judge handled the post\u2011trial Brady motion and the trial itself."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01b1e0b1cf378dcae284afc0a584df56fc27ae927c62a176f44a3df1c7568b54",
