  "overview": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "John S. Williams",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01b1e0b1cf378dcae284afc0a584df56fc27ae927c62a176f44a3df1c7568b54",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01b1e0b1cf37-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to John S. Williams, the petitioners allege that the prosecution suppressed Brady\u2011material evidence that a serial assaulter was seen acting suspiciously at the crime scene before police arrived."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "John S. Williams",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01b1e0b1cf378dcae284afc0a584df56fc27ae927c62a176f44a3df1c7568b54",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01b1e0b1cf37-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to John S. Williams, the petitioners also claim the prosecution withheld evidence that the assailant\u2019s girlfriend was present in the alley at the time of the attack."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Rice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01b1e0b1cf378dcae284afc0a584df56fc27ae927c62a176f44a3df1c7568b54",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01b1e0b1cf37-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Rice, the petitioners argue that the government failed to turn over evidence of two alternative perpetrators."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Rice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01b1e0b1cf378dcae284afc0a584df56fc27ae927c62a176f44a3df1c7568b54",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01b1e0b1cf37-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Rice, the petitioners further allege that impeachment evidence showing a key witness had persuaded another witness to lie was suppressed."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Dreeben",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01b1e0b1cf378dcae284afc0a584df56fc27ae927c62a176f44a3df1c7568b54",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01b1e0b1cf37-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Dreeben, the government contends that the evidence of a group attack was strong and corroborated by multiple eyewitnesses."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01b1e0b1cf378dcae284afc0a584df56fc27ae927c62a176f44a3df1c7568b54",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01b1e0b1cf37-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Government, the government states that it searched diligently for witnesses, noting that the alley\u2019s surrounding buildings included a bank with no windows and brick walls."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01b1e0b1cf378dcae284afc0a584df56fc27ae927c62a176f44a3df1c7568b54",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01b1e0b1cf37-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A fact recorded by the court indicates that an anonymous woman identified a person named Clifton Yarborough standing by the alley on the night of the crime."
      }
    ],
